<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5123] Ignite.cache(String) returns null in PluginProvider.onIgniteStart()</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5123</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Given an Ignite node that has pre-configured caches (via IgniteConfiguration.setCacheConfiguration) if you try to obtain a reference to the cache instance in PluginProvider.onIgniteStart() you&apos;ll get a null reference.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;@Override&lt;br/&gt;
public void onIgniteStart() throws IgniteCheckedException {&lt;br/&gt;
    ignite.cacheNames().forEach(name -&amp;gt; &lt;/p&gt;
{
        assert ignite.cache(name) != null : &quot;Cache is null: &quot; + name;
    }
&lt;p&gt;);&lt;br/&gt;
}&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13068170">IGNITE-5123</key>
